---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="没有找到" description="地址可能写错了，或者内容已经挪走。" section="迷失">
  <section class="page missing-page">
    <svg class="missing-pulse" viewBox="0 0 320 44" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M 0 22 L 88 22 L 96 27 L 106 7 L 114 36 L 122 22 L 156 22 L 320 22" />
    </svg>
    <span class="missing-number" aria-hidden="true">404</span>
    <div class="empty-state">
      <span class="eyebrow">SAVE POINT NOT FOUND</span>
      <h1>这段路，还没有存档。</h1>
      <p>地址可能写错了，或者内容已经挪走。</p>
      <nav class="missing-links" aria-label="继续浏览">
        <a href="/">回首页 ↗</a>
        <a href="/blog/">看文章 ↗</a>
        <a href="/search/">搜索 ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
